    Note over AnalyseTexte: extract personnages, lieux, and events from Doc

    loop each entity in Doc.ents
        alt entity is PERSON and not title
            AnalyseTexte->>Utils: nettoyer(ent.text)
            AnalyseTexte->>AnalyseTexte: _ajouter_personnage(nom, Doc)
